          },
          "body": "`Path.copyToRecursively` accepts error handler and it catches and delegates all errors thrown during traversal and copying to that hander. The handler accepts resolved destination path, but destination path resolution can throw an exception. As a result, such exceptions were never delivered to the handler.\r\n\r\n^KT-85614 fixed",
